# React Components

- Use functional components and hooks.
- Import shared UI from `@/app/components/ui/`; use `cn()` from `@/app/components/ui/utils` for class merging.
- Pages live under `src/app/components/` (Layout, Home, Menu, Location, Footer); routing in `src/app/routes.tsx` with Layout and child routes.
- For mobile-only logic use `useIsMobile()` from `@/app/components/ui/use-mobile.ts` (`max-width: 767px`, i.e. `<768px`).
